From 7fc82677317779023ba60b9201f6511391c7a361 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.local>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 04:11:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Extend TypeSafe integration: abuse probe, reply gate,
 /dev/intent, farm context

Four more System One decision points, all confidence-gated and fallback-safe: abuse probe in the intent fan-out (P>=0.85 -> guarded reply, no agent wake-up), optional reply quality gate (TYPESAFE_REPLY_CHECK=1, extreme-no -> deterministic fallback, gate failures never lose answers), GET /dev/intent inspector (both engines + full probability distribution + would-fast-path), and /advisory farm context (growth_stage/soil/irrigation sanitized into the state). decide_intent() is now the single routing decision shared by /chat and /dev/intent. 85 tests pass offline.
